 ],
 "synopsis": "Clean Max Enviro Energy Solutions shares worth 1,199 crore rupees changed hands in a block deal on Monday, September 28, 2026. A total of 87.97 lakh shares, representing 7.5 percent of the company equity, were traded at 1,363 rupees per share, causing the stock to gain. The official buyers and sellers of this specific transaction are not yet known, although prior reports indicated that Augment India Holdings was set to sell a stake in the company. Promoter entities held a 49.42 percent stake in Clean Max Enviro Energy Solutions at the end of the June quarter, while public shareholders held 50.58 percent.",
